# Silicon, diamond cubic (Fd-3m), conventional 8-atom cell.
# Lattice constant 5.4309 A is the experimental value, NOT a DFT-relaxed one --
# Materials Project's PBE cell for mp-149 is slightly larger. Do not treat
# agreement with this cell as agreement with MP's reference data.
#
# Also serves as the fractional-coordinate test fixture: every position below
# is fractional, so a parser that fails to multiply through the cell will place
# all 8 atoms inside a 1 A box. Correct nearest-neighbour distance is
# a*sqrt(3)/4 = 2.3517 A.
data_Si
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M   'F d -3 m'
_cell_length_a                   5.4309
_cell_length_b                   5.4309
_cell_length_c                   5.4309
_cell_angle_alpha                90.0
_cell_angle_beta                 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma                90.0
_chemical_formula_structural     Si
_chemical_formula_sum            'Si8'
loop_
 _atom_site_type_symbol
 _atom_site_fract_x
 _atom_site_fract_y
 _atom_site_fract_z
 Si  0.00000  0.00000  0.00000
 Si  0.50000  0.50000  0.00000
 Si  0.50000  0.00000  0.50000
 Si  0.00000  0.50000  0.50000
 Si  0.25000  0.25000  0.25000
 Si  0.75000  0.75000  0.25000
 Si  0.75000  0.25000  0.75000
 Si  0.25000  0.75000  0.75000
